==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card features the [[Alolan form]] of {{p|Graveler}}.
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Guardians Rising|Alolan Graveler|41}} from the {{TCG|Guardians Rising}} expansion.
*'''Heavy Impact''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Dark Steelix|10}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

